    "description": {
      "summary": "You beckon the earth to absorb into the subject’s skin reducing the damage from physical attacks",
      "value": "<p>You beckon the earth to absorb into the subject’s skin reducing the damage from physical attacks. For the duration of the spell, the target receives Damage Reduction 10/adamantine. It ignores the first 10 points of damage each time it takes damage from physical attacks, though an adamantine weapon bypasses the reduction. Once the spell has prevented a total of 10 points of damage per caster level (maximum 150 points), it is discharged.</p>"
